IMAPAccount posteo
Host posteo.de
User franz.keilholz@posteo.de
PassCmd "secret-tool lookup service mbsync user franz.keilholz@posteo.de"
TLSType IMAPS
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt

IMAPStore posteo-remote
Account posteo

MaildirStore posteo-local
Path ~/mail/posteo/
Inbox ~/mail/posteo/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel posteo
Far :posteo-remote:
Near :posteo-local:
Patterns *
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *


